  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e76f28faa470635270d2ea0d81e81b5a620738d4_0.webp\" alt=\"Mizuno Fresh Animation\">一个让Mizuno Craft与Fresh Animations兼容的资源包</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1170474/description_a167584b-d7fd-440f-8839-82024adaffcf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"386\" height=\"219\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Fabric版本：<br></strong>需要&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ETF</a> 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMF</a><br>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a></p><p><strong>Optifine版本：<br></strong>视频设置 &gt; 画质 <br>自定义实体模型：开启 <br>随机实体：开启（可选） <br>自发光纹理：开启（可选）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>我所有的Mizuno附加包：<br></strong></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno Better Leaves</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unofficial-mizunos\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Unofficial Mizuno's</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-connected-texture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Connected Texture</a><br></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-x-fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno x Fresh Animations</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-dark-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Dark Mode</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Connected Glass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-eating-animation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Eating Animation</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-better-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Better Grass</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizuno-copper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno Copper Tools</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-allay-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Allay Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's Chicken Variants</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-chicken-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's Chicken Variants x FA</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-fox-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Fox Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Cow Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-cow-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Cow Variants x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Pig Variants</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-pig-variants-x-fa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's Pig Variants x FA</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Farmer's Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-storage-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Storage Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-crate-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Crate Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-frights-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Frights Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-display-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Display Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-rustic-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mizuno's x Rustic Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mizunos-x-ubes-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mizuno's x Ube's Delight</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https:/